    {
      "id": "related.panels.curse-intro",
      "source": "It seems you have been <color=#3B3B7A>Cursed</color><sprite name=\"Curse\">!",
      "translation": "你似乎受到了<color=#3B3B7A>诅咒</color><sprite name=\"Curse\">！",
      "context": "*",
      "kind": "exact",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": "诅咒帮助的独立介绍句。"
    },
    {
      "id": "related.panels.curse-body",
      "source": "<color=#3B3B7A>Curse</color><sprite name=\"Curse\"> grants <color=#3B3B7A>Cursed Hit Chance</color><sprite name=\"Curse\">. By default,\n<color=#3B3B7A>Cursed Hits</color><sprite name=\"Curse\"> have <color=red>x0.50</color> chance for <color=#A61FFF>Hit</color> Effects to happen.\n<color=#3B3B7A>Curse</color><sprite name=\"Curse\"> can also downgrade Room Rewards, spawn <color=#8000FF>Reapers</color>,\nmake <color=#A61FFF>Weapons</color> have bad Enchantments, maximize Shop Prices and much more.\nYou can use Purging Stones do dispel a stack of <color=#3B3B7A>Curse</color><sprite name=\"Curse\">.",
      "translation": "<color=#3B3B7A>诅咒</color><sprite name=\"Curse\">会赋予<color=#3B3B7A>诅咒命中几率</color><sprite name=\"Curse\">。默认情况下，\n<color=#3B3B7A>诅咒命中</color><sprite name=\"Curse\">以原本<color=red>x0.50</color>的几率触发<color=#A61FFF>命中</color>效果。\n<color=#3B3B7A>诅咒</color><sprite name=\"Curse\">还会降低房间奖励品质、召唤<color=#8000FF>收割者</color>，\n使<color=#A61FFF>武器</color>获得负面附魔、令商店价格达到最高等。\n你可以使用净化石来移除一层<color=#3B3B7A>诅咒</color><sprite name=\"Curse\">。",
      "context": "*",
      "kind": "exact",
      "status": "translated",
      "note": "完整诅咒帮助正文；保留标签、图标、x0.50 和原有换行。"
    },
    {
      "id": "related.panels.native.12",
